<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina sets $18.9 million in overnight repos.</title>
<headline>Argentina sets $18.9 million in overnight repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Friday it allocated $18.9 million in overnight repurchase agreements.</p>
<p>Call money fell to 6.95 percent from 7.05 percent at the close Thursday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar fell to 0.99940 pesos from 0.99981 pesos Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
